# What CI installs besides jobdork's own dependencies (pyproject.toml, with
# its dev, pdf and ai extras): the tools the workflows run, pinned with them
# in requirements-ci.lock, so a test, scan or guide build fetches nothing
# unchecked. Each is exact, as in the workflows before the lock.
setuptools>=77                 # building jobdork itself (pyproject [build-system])
